/*
  InboxBody.strings
  TeslaSync — P4 feature view · 0183 · InboxBody (Apple)

  The P1/S10 i18n catalog contribution for this surface. Every key the native
  inbox resolves (table "InboxBody") lives here with its web value. These entries
  fold into the app `Localizable.xcstrings` master catalog at integration time;
  they are kept per-surface so each parallel prompt owns its strings without
  editing the shared catalog.

  The first group is the exact keys + web English defaults extracted from the web
  source (features/notifications/components/InboxBody.tsx, plus the NotificationRow
  / NotificationGroupRow rows it composes). The second group backs native-only
  chrome (the read-state control, the freshness banners, accessibility, the
  segmented-control labels) that the web expresses through the URL / DOM.
*/

